    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0007",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p079-06578-s004",
      "sentenceText": "The Wealth of Nations was a surprisingly fascinating read.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eb94dc148f97e2507053f90a0cd82a150cf0f17106f91eab4522babdc723b4a0",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p079-06578-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-004",
      "parentFingerprint": "80f74cb827767a1801ebe10ff832fbada872abe23f966ec1de5ffaaec1386bac",
      "passageSha256": "b6979ffe004f4eeff63cb777707c152fd1f6c877336bb2e6b323cb96ec0f18af",
      "pdfPages": [
        79,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0008",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p079-06578-s006",
      "sentenceText": "I even named the first book I wrote in English The Psychological Wealth of Nations.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f5e1cedf6e91214129f00f8f643db0191f78e7d9e9c6aafff803f1499e7513d9",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p079-06578-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "eedf8b5d3a16204a7447df9d2ca853a07f6ebbd406906031ea163bb681e13ad0",
      "passageSha256": "c0749a0de1c93286b54666ed35a19e81f8b69d5f7e03ba0121c41957abf55d10",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0009",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Just like any good book, The Wealth of Nations starts with a marvelous observation.",
      "sentenceSha256": "29ce4e56ff89796ca66cade9506b15ff975935b900152da1ef661e1d3ab2d561",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "1231db08151ca0991a01df49ab6501d169149e1a7a0268baf4fb4b83addd376e",
      "passageSha256": "9cd09e23d9773fb6b8b3c89219f1e067032a6877db0b9beb062944c883271818",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0010",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Imagine a pin factory.",
      "sentenceSha256": "65d5c4fea367556b59ef537fb65c3ac9c1ce153aa4bd3689dafae213f176110f",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "1231db08151ca0991a01df49ab6501d169149e1a7a0268baf4fb4b83addd376e",
      "passageSha256": "9cd09e23d9773fb6b8b3c89219f1e067032a6877db0b9beb062944c883271818",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0011",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-s004",
      "sentenceText": "This means that ten workers, working independently, would produce only ten pins a day.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2312ce6b335947d833adb4c14b73732ef618b7d4510792143bd53c8567b1baea",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "1231db08151ca0991a01df49ab6501d169149e1a7a0268baf4fb4b83addd376e",
      "passageSha256": "9cd09e23d9773fb6b8b3c89219f1e067032a6877db0b9beb062944c883271818",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0012",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-s005",
      "sentenceText": "But what if these ten workers each specialized in one or two operations?",
      "sentenceSha256": "4f0c2b14d32e1f250edbab062d63deb4a17fbc059a645fe9b36322b40cb37ab9",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "28153db3ce95b894edc8215a18be736b56f7e398bbd0c5b53d92dbcf3f069344",
      "passageSha256": "418e0b8215c6779c5edafafd933da0fd94de04dd5d82d8756fffaac5ea026d75",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0013",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-s006",
      "sentenceText": "For example, one person draws out the wire, another straightens it, another cuts it, another sharpens its top, and so forth.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6cec5a6c8195cb8e7fb9cd5f510c8c6942310808a8145d99b679b30a0322b882",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "28153db3ce95b894edc8215a18be736b56f7e398bbd0c5b53d92dbcf3f069344",
      "passageSha256": "418e0b8215c6779c5edafafd933da0fd94de04dd5d82d8756fffaac5ea026d75",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0014",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-s008",
      "sentenceText": "Thus, a very simple division of labor would increase productivity by 4,800 times!",
      "sentenceSha256": "c7f020fecc5a982074e51b433eb72b7e108ff91f1ea2338912c9bb100ff8d51c",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-01725-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "28153db3ce95b894edc8215a18be736b56f7e398bbd0c5b53d92dbcf3f069344",
      "passageSha256": "418e0b8215c6779c5edafafd933da0fd94de04dd5d82d8756fffaac5ea026d75",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0015",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The Wealth of Nations was published in 1776, the year the U.S. declared independence.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5ee60a4727a249f957141056c9242fbbe88ace2020486dbc43f2f763c9b55b5d",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "5c82ac153c70a6267c2482ae4db89597e1911f4f3ceabe3f14242b3f46f2118e",
      "passageSha256": "ac381f5d00172fb150ee020f1d4bad8af2809591765856fcd703594782923671",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0016",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-s002",
      "sentenceText": "At that time, the U.S. was largely an agricultural society without any factories.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3c0117567d2f7882f7cffae24ad0a476411b1d622df99d6fa10de858a4a2f539",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "5c82ac153c70a6267c2482ae4db89597e1911f4f3ceabe3f14242b3f46f2118e",
      "passageSha256": "ac381f5d00172fb150ee020f1d4bad8af2809591765856fcd703594782923671",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0017",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In 1908, Henry Ford started producing the popular Model T. At first, his factory was able to produce only a few models a day.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ad7f893e84defa8a0a878b8e269874d0564e7e13b42d011abeb2828e1d76472f",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "5c82ac153c70a6267c2482ae4db89597e1911f4f3ceabe3f14242b3f46f2118e",
      "passageSha256": "ac381f5d00172fb150ee020f1d4bad8af2809591765856fcd703594782923671",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0018",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-s006",
      "sentenceText": "After all, how much smaller can we make each operation?",
      "sentenceSha256": "304939e9f6df918715abd05822ecc81ca3d79a64b47dce031352702393ff8fd1",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s01-p080-03870-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-010",
      "parentFingerprint": "9ec800e9379379445ddbb62670b468bbce78a94e45efe3306a1995d3eaf7f3df",
      "passageSha256": "0c8bb1037b89a033c0f859cd8830f46979d516b9bc6c1039e369decf5a1efb70",
      "pdfPages": [
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0019",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s02-p080-06525-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In the past, the division of labor was mostly limited to workplaces such as factories, farms, and restaurants.",
      "sentenceSha256": "37b370543c03428062cec5939093a92669b1877b3964bd79f2b4affcf063b8c7",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s02-p080-06525-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "d0fa6a53f4a50d9dab0c841301ff0f6aedc403e731052dc898b49d0bc721c62d",
      "passageSha256": "b02dddd7743331148faf8cf6bb31f7d29b9ec9f05dca254667a54d9239c8fddc",
      "pdfPages": [
        80,
        81
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0020",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s02-p080-06525-s002",
      "sentenceText": "At home, most people were cooking, cleaning, and doing laundry by themselves until the 1990s, even as microwaves, laundry machines, and dishwashers made house chores easier and less time-consuming.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b33264350504d39155db559b431e8728f8128cbb0edd14600a73106596961022",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s02-p080-06525-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-011",
      "parentFingerprint": "d0fa6a53f4a50d9dab0c841301ff0f6aedc403e731052dc898b49d0bc721c62d",
      "passageSha256": "b02dddd7743331148faf8cf6bb31f7d29b9ec9f05dca254667a54d9239c8fddc",
      "pdfPages": [
        80,
        81
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0021",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s02-p080-06525-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Busy professionals use AIs for scheduling, planning, and even financial investments.",
      "sentenceSha256": "35a87ca58583dce670f4f36737221f8676f25610cc2d9f53264e8ea145805bcb",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s02-p080-06525-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-012",
      "parentFingerprint": "54f568d241e19ae829957684f4680e03be491ce98527f3fc4fe2e18f51121547",
      "passageSha256": "1524935d033fc0a5202b772c9b4cbb928676816ba7d10114b2fe831aa748353a",
      "pdfPages": [
        81
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0022",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s02-p081-02115-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In academia, big team science is taking over traditional small lab science, requiring a great degree of division of labor.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a7383930a73dad100a8d1df38dcc0760c03f0bf2dc7acfee5d913e3dde8496a0",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s02-p081-02115-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "64c2c3321e069587867278b662665d53291ad11f22af66281846490cc0957d0b",
      "passageSha256": "dac2f8b4151d93dcc3ecf067aab0c5d81d604562adad8da4c37868e584f07fce",
      "pdfPages": [
        81
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0023",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s02-p081-02115-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Each team member does their part; then the team quickly assembles all the parts and moves on to the next paper.",
      "sentenceSha256": "01be5d31b5c37c8b33bf9b69690f869451f94515ab1b39cf9299679a782886c0",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s02-p081-02115-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "64c2c3321e069587867278b662665d53291ad11f22af66281846490cc0957d0b",
      "passageSha256": "dac2f8b4151d93dcc3ecf067aab0c5d81d604562adad8da4c37868e584f07fce",
      "pdfPages": [
        81
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s03-p081-05745-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Karl Marx famously speculated about various negative consequences of the division of labor.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1419c8d8627123699eda828d2b661df6551ef695ea5dd3c50f74a2f53830f70a",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s03-p081-05745-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "f69098bad6ed351c3b37177901f9036d36c137e6c914ce19c6ad3349a1a9f0d8",
      "passageSha256": "85f8b08e215c824627813765052207ff2d5c7465fbe2c374b38685b7d2b3f4eb",
      "pdfPages": [
        81
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s03-p081-05745-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Marx argued that the division of labor “mortifies the body and ruins the mind.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "6ea35152eea92b68e39ae6acbf9f3a7c6a3916241afde3795653c716ec6768f9",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s03-p081-05745-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c08-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a018a7e78f7ae1d22d1e68f6e54de27bd836bd32db7633134f9a327bac3bc73",
      "passageSha256": "01e38587bcf938c747230d8822ae7ba50d7afb3ccec5501f69c0bc14e18f3d0a",
      "pdfPages": [
        82
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c08-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c08-s03-p082-02115-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In his presidential address to the American Sociological Association in 1985, Kai Erikson discussed how Marx’s theory of alienation is still relevant in the modern workplace.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c72869a0cc2b1084804055266547966d6c975d662dd655bc43313439aa1bbfb3",
      "readingUnitId": "c08-s03-p082-02115-r001-003",
